{"symbol":"UTKARSHBNK","yahoo":"UTKARSHBNK.NS","bse":null,"isin":"INE735W01017","name":"Utkarsh Small Finance Bank Limited","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Regional","website":"https://www.utkarsh.bank.in","about":"Utkarsh Small Finance Bank Limited provides banking and financial services in India. It operates through Corporate/Wholesale Banking, Retail Banking, Treasury, and Other Banking Operations segments. The company offers savings, salary, current, term and recurring deposit, escrow, and RERA banking accounts; term, fixed, and recurring deposits; locker facilities; digital products; investment products; joint liability group, business, MSME, commercial vehicle and construction equipment, gold, personal, housing, individual, group, and other loans, as well as loans for the purchase of commercial properties; wholesale lending; overdraft against fixed deposit, LAP retail, and Micro LAP; outward remittances; positive pay; UPI payment solutions; and bill and credit card bill payment services. It also provides institutional, NRI, micro, retail, corporate, and wholesale banking; cash management; branch, internet, mobile, and WhatsApp banking services; digital onboarding; online account opening facilities; ATMs and micro-ATMs; debit and credit cards; mutual funds; and life, health, and general insurance. The company serves low and middle-income households, micro-entrepreneurs, women entrepreneurs, self-employed individuals, small and marginal farmers, MSMEs, corporates, and institutional customers. Utkarsh Small Finance Bank Limited was founded in 2009 and is headquartered in Varanasi, India.","updated":"2026-09-25T13:46:30+00:00","quote":{"price":13.8,"prevClose":13.86,"marketCap":2455.74,"high52":22.57,"low52":10.12,"pe":null,"bookValue":15.65,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":null,"shares":177.9524,"insiders":53.15,"institutions":11.87},"prices":{"dates":["2023-07-21","2023-07-24","2023-07-25","2023-07-26","2023-07-27","2023-07-28","2023-07-31","2023-08-01